                <h3 class="card-link-title">Does it work across Australia?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Yes. Anywhere WhatsApp works, Quickler works, from metro depots to remote regional sites. See how the same approach runs <a href="/pages/global-field-compliance.html">in any country</a>.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Do crews need to install anything?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">No. They use WhatsApp on the phone they already carry. There is no app, no login and no per-user fee, so a subcontractor can complete a job on day one.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Can it run our own forms?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Yes. Upload your inspection, checklist or certificate and Quickler builds it into a workflow. Browse the <a href="/pages/services.html">workflow types</a> it supports.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">What do managers actually see?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">A live dashboard of structured records with red, amber and green fault status, plus PDF export whenever a formal document is needed.</p>
